('phantom', '2026-11-16', 'post', 'single', 'Why Phantom', 'We fly less', 'Weather Window: guests give 2+ days in a 7-day period; the head guide sends updates in the Phantom app 7 and 3 days out; final call by 4:30 pm the day before (or 7:30 am). Full refund if there is no flyable day. 10% deposit. Single date: move free, or refund less 5%.', 'Already drafted in Meta Business Suite (6:30 PM): Ross adds photos and schedules it there, so don''t publish this one from Brand Studio.', null, 'https://phantomheli.com', 'planned', 'phantom-plan-v2'),
